 "strings": {
  "Meaning for the public at large,\nhe as good as did it.": "",
  "Meaning for the public at large...\nhe's not innocent. May as well be guilty.": "",
  "Okubo got laid off from his job, and had his\npersonal details smeared all over the internet.": "",
  "Okubo got laid off from his job. Naturally,\nhis personal details got put all over the internet.": "",
  "The guy barely even went outside.\nCouldn't sleep at night without his pills.": "",
  "But I didn't ask him about any of that.\nDidn't really care, either.": "",
  "Until one day, Okubo gave up his years of sobriety,\nstarted drinking... and stabbed his girlfriend to death.": "",
  "Until one day... it happened. After years of\nsobriety, he relapsed and stabbed his girlfriend.": "",
  "And what, you think that's your fault?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Why did Shinpei Okubo kill Emi Terasawa?\nIf it's anyone's fault...)</color>": "",
  "Even so, I don't think your old man\ndid anything wrong.": "",
  "Your old man did nothing wrong. He did what\na defense lawyer's supposed to do.": "",
  "Our job's showing that the prosecution doesn't\nhave enough evidence. Not finding the truth.": "",
  "We question the prosecution, find holes in their story,\nand doubt their evidence. We don't go hunt down the truth!": "",
  "And when you defended Okubo the first time around,\nthat's exactly what you did.": "",
  "And you... Back when you defended Okubo,\nyou did the defense's job perfectly.": "",
  "Listen to me, Yagami.\nYou didn't do anything wrong.": "",
  "Listen to me.\nYou didn't do anything wrong.": "",
  "Sure, I get what you're saying.": "",
  "I hear what you're saying, sensei.": "",
  "But a girl burned to death because I was good\nat my job. Ever think about how that feels?": "",
  "But... thanks to my defense, an innocent girl\nburned to death. How am I <font_kind=yakuza_italic>supposed</font_kind> to feel?": "",
  "It's easy to sit back and tell me I did nothing\nwrong, but put yourself in my shoes.": "",
  "It's easy to sit back and tell me how to feel now,\nbut what if this happened to you!?": "",
  "Could you say you did the right thing?": "",
  "You'd just <font_kind=yakuza_italic>get over</font_kind> it?": "",
  "That's enough! How long are you gonna\nlet this dominate your life!?": "",
  "That's enough! Dammit...\nHow long are you gonna let this dominate your life!?": "",
  "...For as long as I live.": "",
  "Yagami speaking.": "",
  "Hey, it's Hoshino.\nI've arranged our chat with Okubo.": "",
  "It's Hoshino.\nI've arranged our chat with Okubo.": "",
  "Meet me at the taxi stand on West Shichifuku Street.\nI'm on my way there now.": "",
  "I appreciate the concern.": "",
  "I've said all I wanted to say.\nIt's fine.": "",
  "I said my piece.\nNothing more to say.": "",
  "I half knew you weren't\ngonna listen anyway.": "",
  "Knew you weren't gonna\nlisten anyway.": "",
  "Genda-sensei.": "",
  "You and I both saw what happens when you don't\npursue the truth. I can't let that go. I won't.": "",
  "You and I both saw what happens when you don't\npursue the truth. I can't... I'll never let that go.": "",
  "Over here, Yagami-san!": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-san! Over here!": "",
  "We're finally going to see Okubo...\nGo ahead and get in, Yagami-san.": "",
  "We're finally going to see Okubo...\nGo ahead and get in.": "",
  "The prosecution had more than enough evidence\nto convict you for Emi's murder.": "",
  "Everything pointed to you killing Emi-chan.\nThey had all the proof they needed.": "",
  "It was an open and shut case.\nThere was nothing we could do.": "",
  "We couldn't do anything against\nthat kind of evidence.": "",
  "Of course not. How am I gonna win when my own\nlawyer doesn't believe I'm innocent?": "",
  "Of course we couldn't. Even you...\nYou had already condemned me.": "",
  "Don't think I couldn't tell.": "",
  "Don't think I didn't notice.": "",
  "Every time you went up there and tried to clear my\nname... you looked like you were gonna puke.": "",
  "Whenever you were up there defending me...\nI saw it in your face. You looked ready to puke.": "",
  "So, um... Okubo-san.\nYou really didn't do it either time?": "",
  "Um... so... in both cases,\nyou were truly innocent?": "",
  "That's what I've been saying all along.": "",
  "I've been saying that\nall along.": "",
  "My name is Hoshino,\nfrom the Genda Law office.": "",
  "If you don't mind, we have a theory about\nthe ADDC incident you were on trial for.": "",
  "Yagami-san and I... We're working on a theory.\nOne that concerns the case at the ADDC.": "",
  "I do mind.\nIt doesn't have anything to do with me.": "",
  "And?\nIt doesn't have anything to do with me.": "",
  "But don't you want to know\nwho really killed Waku-san?": "",
  "But... don't you want to know\nwho the real killer is?": "",
  "It was an ADDC researcher\nby the name of Yoji Shono.": "",
  "It was an ADDC researcher.\nYoji Shono.": "",
  "I remember him.": "",
  "But... You're saying... he did it?\nWhy though?": "",
  "Huh...? But he's the killer? Why?": "",
  "Here, let me explain.": "",
  "Waku-san's death was an AD-9 related accident.\nThat's our theory, at least.": "",
  "We did some digging. Waku-san's death was an\n AD-9-related accident... At least, that's our theory.": "",
  "The drug must have killed him on the spot.\nShono panicked, searching for a place to hide the body.": "",
  "Shono was testing some drugs, but when they killed\nthe patient, he panicked and tried to hide the body. So...": "",
  "Which led him to my truck, huh?": "",
  "So he went to my truck?\nThat's why this happened?": "",
  "Yeah. It must've been the only option\nhe could think of.": "",
  "Yup. It must've been the only option\nShono could think of.": "",
  "Things may have turned out differently\nhad you actually reported finding Waku-san's body.": "",
  "Makes me think. If you'd reported finding the body,\nthings might have turned out pretty differently.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Maybe the police would have actually\nsuspected Shono instead.)</color>": "",
  "But as we both know,\nthat's not what happened.": "",
  "But... we both know that's\nnot what happened.": "",
  "So all this...\nwas because I buried the body?": "",
  "So all this... was because\nI buried the body?": "",
  "It was a better stroke of luck\nthan Shono could have ever asked for.": "",
  "It was a better stroke of luck\nthan Shono could ever have asked for.": "",
  "After all,\nthe cops never even suspected him.": "",
  "After all, the cops never\neven suspected him.": "",
  "I think I'm going to head back to Genda's.\nWhat are you up to tonight?": "",
  "I think I'm going to head back to work.\nWhat are you up to tonight?": "",
  "Not sure yet.": "",
  "I think maybe I'll swing by Tender.": "",
  "Maybe... I'll swing by Tender.": "",
  "...I could use a drink.": "",
  "That was... I could use a drink.": "",
  "I'll be all right.\nLater, Hoshino-kun.": "",
  "I'll be all right.\nYou better get going.": "",
  "So, I hear you're defending Ayabe.": "",
  "I had to come congratulate you myself on your\ntriumphant return to the courtroom.": "",
  "Which makes this your grand return to the courtroom.\nCongratulations are in order.": "",
  "I'm not gonna be the one defending him.\nJust helping with the investigation.": "",
  "Wasn't Shintani-sensei your mentor?\nYou're \"helping\" to free the man who murdered him.": "",
  "Wasn't Shintani-sensei your mentor?\nYou're \"helping\" to free the man who murdered him?": "",
  "Hmph. Are you confused or just desperate\nfor a few scraps off the table?": "",
  "Hmph. Figures. I doubt you realize\njust how confused you are.": "",
  "But it wouldn't be the first murderer\nyou've set loose in our city. Not a good look. ": "",
  "You keep setting murderers loose in our city.\nIt's getting annoying.": "",
  "Ayabe didn't kill Shintani.": "",
  "His gun begs to differ.\nThe rifling matches the marks on the bullet.": "",
  "Yeah, that's how the real killer\nframed him for it.": "",
  "Yeah. That's how the real killer\nframed Ayabe.": "",
  "If you seriously can't see that,\nthen I'm not the confused one here.": "",
  "If you seriously can't see that...\nthen I'm not the confused one here.": "",
  "Say what you will.": "",
  "Um, hello? \nYou need something?": "",
  "And what's your problem?\nYou need something?": "",
  "More or less.": "",
  "Guess I do.": "",
  "Doesn't look like you're here to talk.": "",
  "...Doesn't look like you're here to talk.": "",
  "That's right. Your little\ndetective game's over, Yagami.": "",
  "Your little detective game's\nover, Yagami.": "",
  "Wait, is that... Yagami-san!": "",
  "Hoshino-kun, stay back!": "",
  "Hoshino-kun, stop! Get back!": "",
  "This guy's dangerous.": "",
  "Stay away. This guy's dangerous.": "",
  "I can see that...": "",
  "Die, Yagami!": "",
  "(Need to get my mind off the case.\nI could use a drink right about now.)": "",
  "Hrgh, dammit!": "",
  "Yagami-san! Are you okay!?": "",
  "Are you okay, Yagami-san!?": "",
  "I'm fine. But that guy...\nwasn't messing around.": "",
  "...Yeah. Turns out...\nhe wasn't messing around.": "",
  "He would have killed me\nfor sure if I'd let him.": "",
  "That guy really wanted to kill me.": "",
  "Hm. Maybe one of Hamura's men?": "",
  "Maybe one of Hamura's men?": "",
  "What's up, Tak?\nHow'd your chat with Okubo go?": "",
  "Kaito here. You saw Okubo, right?\nHow'd it go?": "",
  "Listen, someone just tried to murder me.\nProbably sent by Hamura.": "",
  "Watch your back, Kaito-san.\nWhere are you now?": "",
  "Right by the office.\nGot Sugiura with me, too.": "",
  "Don't go back there.\nNot now.": "",
  "Better stay somewhere else\nfor now.": "",
  "Hm. All right,\nI got a place.": "",
  "All right... I got a place.": "",
  "KJ Art. The Kyorei HQ.\nHamura ain't gonna touch us there.": "",
  "The Kyorei HQ. KJ Art.\nHamura ain't gonna touch us there.": "",
  "Wait, you're gonna go there after we beat the crap\nout of Shioya and his whole crew in that club?": "",
  "I dunno... After we beat the crap out of\nShioya in that club?": "",
  "You think they'll just let us hang out?": "",
  "You really think they'll just let us in?": "",
  "'Course I do.\nWe've got Kajihira on our side.": "",
  "'Course I do. Now that we've got\nthe big bad chairman on our side.": "",
  "We'll go on ahead.\nGet your ass over there quick, yeah?": "",
  "We'll go on ahead.\nDon't take too long.": "",
  "Sounds like we're meeting at KJ Art.": "",
  "Sounds like we're\nmeeting at KJ Art.": "",
  "I heard.": "",
  "I heard as much.": "",
  "Well, let's go.": "",
  "This is, um... \nThe Kyorei Clan headquarters, right?": "",
  "So... this is the Kyorei Clan\nheadquarters, right?": "",
  "Last I checked.": "",
  "This is gonna shave\nsome years off my life...": "",
  "Man, I'm so nervous...": "",
  "I'm nervous too.": "",
  "Yagami-san.\nWho's your little buddy?": "",
  "Yagami-san. Who's your friend?": "",
  "I'm uh, Hoshino... sir.\nFrom the Genda Law Office.": "",
  "I'm from the Genda Law Office...\nMy name's Hoshino.": "",
  "Uh-huh. Well, Kaito-san's already here.": "",
  "Oh yeah? Well, Kaito-san's already here.": "",
  "Sorry to say Shioya's outta the office,\nbut Murase'll be glad to entertain ya. Come on in.": "",
  "Well if it isn't Yagami-sensei!\nCome in, come in.": "",
  "Well if it ain't Yagami-sensei!\nCome in, come in.": "",
  "Sorry 'bout how rude we've been\nto you 'til now.": "",
  "And... sorry 'bout how rude\nwe treated you before.": "",
  "Chairman Kajihira's told us\nto do whatever you say.": "",
  "From now on, your wish is our command.\nChairman Kajihira's orders.": "",
  "Listen to this, Tak. I asked for a massage,\nand he actually gave me one!": "",
  "Man, I asked for a massage,\nand he actually gave me one!": "",
  "I had you all wrong, Murase.\nYou're just a big teddy bear.": "",
  "Murase, I had you pegged all wrong!\nYou're downright squishy.": "",
  "Don't get too carried away, Kaito-san.": "",
  "Let's not get carried away...": "",
  "Maybe I'll see if Shioya'll\nmassage me next.": "",
  "Maybe I oughta ask Shioya\nfor a massage next.": "",
  "Um, I'm gonna say that's\nprobably a bad idea.": "",
  "Eh, that might not go over so well.": "",
  "Anyway, go on and take a load off.": "",
  "Anyway. Go on, take a load off!": "",
  "Hm. So Okubo really didn't kill\nWaku-san all those years ago.": "",
  "...I see. So all those years ago...\nOkubo really <font_kind=yakuza_italic>didn't</font_kind> kill him.": "",
  "If his reaction's anything to go by.": "",
  "If his reaction's anything\nto go by.": "",
  "He might not have even killed his girlfriend.\nAt least, that's how it looked to me.": "",
  "I'd rather not go there right now.": "",
  "Eh, I think that can wait.": "",
  "I've been wonderin', Yagami-sensei.\nWho is that guy?": "",
  "You curious?": "",
  "Can't blame a guy for asking, can ya?": "",
  "Can ya blame me for asking?": "",
  "Apparently he's afraid of yakuza.\nBetter to just leave him alone.": "",
  "From the sounds of things, he's afraid of yakuza.\nBetter to leave him be.": "",
  "Huh. Well okay then...": "",
  "That so? Just as well...": "",
  "So. Shono's looking more\nsuspicious every day.": "",
  "'Bout time for a good old face-to-face?": "",
  "Whatcha think? 'Bout time for\na good old face-to-face?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Yeah... We'll just have to\nconfront Shono about it directly.)</color>": "",
  "Judging from our last visit, we won't be able\nto get an appointment. With Shono or Kido.": "",
  "I doubt we'd be able to make an appointment.\nWith Shono <font_kind=yakuza_italic>or</font_kind> Kido.": "",
  "Then we won't make an appointment.": "",
  "Then we won't make\nan appointment.": "",
  "All we do is wait in the lobby,\nthen ambush Shono when he comes out.": "",
  "All we do is wait for Shono in the lobby,\nthen ambush him when he comes out.": "",
  "A stakeout, huh?\nThat's my kinda job.": "",
  "A stakeout, huh?\nWell, if I gotta do it...": "",
  "Actually, you're gonna be staying back.": "",
  "Nope. You're gonna be staying back.": "",
  "I mean, they'd catch on in a heartbeat\nif they saw a tough guy like you standing around.": "",
  "With a big thug like you standing around\nis gonna make academic types nervous.": "",
  "And Hoshino-kun.\nYou should go back to Genda's.": "",
  "And Hoshino-kun should go\nback to Genda's.": "",
  "Okay, but...": "",
  "All right, then.\nSounds like I'm tagging along.": "",
  "Okay. Sounds like I'm coming\non the ADDC tour.": "",
  "Yeah. Let's go.": "",
  "Yup. Let's go.": "",
  "Man, this place is fucking huge...": "",
  "This place is fucking huge...\nWhat <font_kind=yakuza_italic>is</font_kind> all this?": "",
  "Keep it close to your chest, Sugiura.\nWe're supposed to blend in, remember?": "",
  "Keep it close to your chest, Sugiura.\nWe're supposed to blend in.": "",
  "Now, let's settle down\nand wait for Shono.": "",
  "But what if he already went home?\nC'mon, let's ask somebody.": "",
  "I dunno. What if he already went home?\nC'mon, let's ask somebody.": "",
  "I don't wanna sit here all night\nif he's never coming out.": "",
  "Excuse me, do you mind\nif I ask you something?": "",
  "Is Shono-san from the AD-9 team\nstill here?": "",
  "Has Shono-san from the\nAD-9 team already left?": "",
  "Oh, um, most likely.\nHe's always one of the last researchers to leave.": "",
  "No... He's always one of the\nlast researchers to leave.": "",
  "Do you have an appointment\nwith him, sir?": "",
  "Do you have an appointment?": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "I appreciate the concern.": "ขอบคุณที่เป็นห่วงนะ",
  "More or less.": "ก็พอได้อยู่บ้างครับ",
  "I heard.": "ฉันได้ยินมาแล้ว",
  "Well, let's go.": "เอาล่ะ ไปกันเถอะ",
  "Okay, but...": "โอเค แต่...",
  "Yeah. Let's go.": "ใช่ ไปกันเลย"
 }
}
